Intrinsic
Cognitive Scien ce, the counterpoint to Critical Theory , grew ¼
linguistics, IT , and computer research. In this nature-based theory , œ
is a biological c omputer design ed by evolution. CS believes th at once we
decipher the brain’ s codes and  networks, the ultimate causes of human
