My ö this intrinsic/extrinsic debate is that life always stirs some of
both, ế quality and quant ity of influence between genes and culture
varies widely . More importantly , è nť hi¬ belief systems
contemplates the impact of coincidence.
Consider the research done on identical twins: T wo people born
genetically ¶ will in time take on distinctively ¹
personalities. W hether they are raised together in ¶ fam ily or apart
in ¹ families, they keep certain similarities but ů remain
