On the extrem e Right, the tyrannical Cersei of House L annister ,
Protector ¤ Seven Kingdo ms. On the progressive Left, t he graceful
Daenerys of House T ar garyen, Mother of Dragons.
Cersei embodie s retrogressive, incestuous, matriarch, mon archical
despotism. T emperamentally , she is pro-feudalism and a nti-change.
Daenerys embodies the future-leaning, humanistic spirit of justice and
progress. T emperamentally , ì anti-feudalism and pro-change. Daenerys
denies myth; Cersei Ó myth.
W ithin t his polarized world, ×s array the meritocracy ¤
Night’ s W atch, the equalitarianism ¤ Unsullied, the fanaticism ¤
Sparrows, ª democracy of councils in which equals ca st votes to
make decisions.  Death, è has no politics, so when the Night King
