ą  counteraction strikes from out ¤ blue, surprise jolts the
¡. She suddenly disco vers hidden reactions in places she thought
she knew but no w sees in a whole new light. The impact of thi s surprising
counteraction m ay change her situation to an unforeseen positive, but more
