A d ynamic pivot around a turning point not only gives us ins ights Í
character and her setting but moves emotions ź. Emotion  ½ side
ef fect of  a changing ể in value. Whether the emotion is positive or
negative depends ¯ direction of that change.
ą living value changes from negative to positive, ¥
naturally experi ences a positive emotion. The change from slavery to
